  "_readme": [
    "canonical name_normalized  ->  spelling variants that must collapse into it.",
    "name_normalized is the join key for cross-venue price comparison. If",
    "'Bihari Boti', 'Behari boti' and 'bihari-boti' do not collapse to one",
    "string the comparison feature returns nothing and nobody finds out why.",
    "",
    "Matching is done on the already-cleaned string (lowercased, unaccented,",
    "punctuation stripped, marketing words dropped, portion words moved into",
    "price_unit, singularised). Add variants freely; this file is data, and",
    "extending it does not require touching normalise.py.",
    "",
    "The starting set is docs/SCRAPING-PROMPT.md section 5, extended with the",
    "spellings that actually show up on foodpanda.pk listings."
  ]
